{"id":"be28d7d574c6b831","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Upward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","display":"thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["17-thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_section":"2.1; 3.1","source_result":"Corollary 2.1.6 applied to the elementary diagram; Theorem 3.1.5","source_pages_print":[67,68,138],"source_pages_djvu":[83,84,154],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.3.2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-upward-lowenheim-skolem — Upward Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1; 3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Corollary 2.1.6 applied to the elementary diagram; Theorem 3.1.5"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67</span><span>68</span><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>83</span><span>84</span><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.3.2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>语言符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 与语言基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a> 的接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal parameter)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\n\\land\n\\max\\{|L|,\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\}\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\n\\land\n\\max\\{|L|,\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\}\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The infinitude hypothesis on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is essential; a finite structure cannot have a proper elementary extension of arbitrary infinite cardinality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言符号集 $\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 与语言基数 $|L|$ 取 [[17-df-language-cardinality]] 的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothe